     1,
     "<div style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">There are some issues to ask about you. </div><div style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Issue # 1 : sparse matrix issue in function</p><p><font color=\"#000000\"><span>In a function to </span></font><font color=\"#131313\" face=\"Courier, monospace\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:normal\">MakeADFun</span></font></p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">spatiocorr_sparse &lt;- as(spatiocorr, &quot;sparseMatrix&quot;)  \r\ngrid_nei_sparse &lt;- as(grid_nei, &quot;sparseMatrix&quot;)\r\n</span><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Then it gives </p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Error in .m2sparse.checking(from, &quot;.&quot;, &quot;C&quot;) :</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">invalid type &quot;complex&quot; in &#39;.m2sparse.checking’</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Issue # 2 : precision matrix in dgmrf</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font color=\"#000000\">In a function to </font><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#131313\" face=\"Courier, monospace\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:normal\">MakeADFun</span></font></span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#131313\" face=\"Courier, monospace\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:normal\"><br></span></font></span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> nll &lt;- nll - dgmrf(Delta_A_mg, 0, prec_A_mg, log=TRUE)</p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">It gives </span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Error in dim(x0) &lt;- c(d, length(x0)/d) :   length-0 dimension vector is invalidCalled from: dgmrf(Delta_A_mg, 0, prec_A_mg, log = TRUE)</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Could you give me some help with these issues? </p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Thanks,</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Daniel</p></div>"
    ]
   ]
