1313\" face=\"Courier, monospace\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:normal\"><br></span></font></span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> nll &lt;- nll - dgmrf(Delta_A_mg, 0, prec_A_mg, log=TRUE)</p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">It gives </span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Error in dim(x0) &lt;- c(d, length(x0)/d) :   length-0 dimension vector is invalidCalled from: dgmrf(Delta_A_mg, 0, prec_A_mg, log = TRUE)</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Could you give me some help with these issues? </p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Thanks,</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Daniel</p></div></blockquote></div>"
